{"id": "|D568E356495928FE32A87F8842B4E5C6", "source_en": "Adjust how transparent the subtitle background is.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "ضبط شفافية خلفية الترجمة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|ABCA48CD4FA40A508F04DE91397073D7", "source_en": "Adjust movement sensitivity.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "ضبط حساسية الحركة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|AB12AC154A8CCBE4AEBC5C90AFA873BF", "source_en": "Adjust overall mouse movement sensitivity.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "ضبط حساسية حركة الماوس العامة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|A8E720D54556DE08EB2AEB9B898C1E75", "source_en": "Adjust preset graphics settings that control visual fidelity and performance.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضبط إعدادات الرسومات المسبقة التي تتحكم في دقة الصورة والأداء.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|65F066ED4DC907CE6DCF27910E8756ED", "source_en": "Adjust the border style around subtitle text for readability.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضبط نمط الإطار حول نص الترجمة التوضيحية لتحسين وضوحه.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|8F5A845945DD0DE5D6936C96EEFA2528", "source_en": "Adjust the game's brightness using the on-screen slider.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضبط سطوع اللعبة باستخدام شريط التمرير على الشاشة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|454C0C1F4C3B13C492A1C2B15E1A7796", "source_en": "Adjust the intensity of the colorblind correction using the on-screen preview images.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضبط شدة تصحيح عمى الألوان باستخدام صور المعاينة على الشاشة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|3600B1234D9B1D47ED5D2D82CDF1EF93", "source_en": "Adjust the motion blur effect when the camera moves. Higher quality mimics cinematic film.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضبط تأثير ضبابية الحركة عند تحرك الكاميرا. الجودة الأعلى تحاكي الأفلام السينمائية.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|1DA8C951471728974DD36BA1035C9512", "source_en": "Adjust the size of UI text.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضبط حجم نص واجهة المستخدم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|821CE0354669CA07489E0A9E4276130D", "source_en": "Adjust vertical camera/aim sensitivity.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضبط حساسية الكاميرا/التصويب العمودية.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|772DB57C43610E1CE2109F8A19B5685E", "source_en": "Adjusts the loudness of all audio during fullscreen videos and cutscenes.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضبط مستوى صوت جميع المقاطع الصوتية أثناء مقاطع الفيديو والسينماتيك في وضع ملء الشاشة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "|ADEA11C5437CBE4C32D9958743E8C259", "source_en": "Adjusts the loudness of all sound effects in the game, but not music, voice, or videos.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضبط مستوى صوت جميع المؤثرات الصوتية في اللعبة، باستثناء الموسيقى أو الأصوات الصوتية أو مقاطع الفيديو.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
